{c: Verse 1}
[G]Raaton ko apni [D]palkon se,        [Am]Khwaab sajaane [Bm]do
Phir [G]khabon ko [D]ankhon se,        [G]Neend churaane [Bm]do
[Em]Khaamoshiyan rakhti hain,        [D]Apni bhi ek zubaan
[Em]Khamoshi ko chupke se,        Sab [C]keh jaane [D]do
Kuch to [A]hua hai... [Bm] ..ye kya hua,        Jo na [C]pataa hai... [D] ..ye jo hua
